{
 "about": "^report(47), experiments 3, 4 and 5 on the Witch slide (DataExperiment, e69234eb95): ids minted per edit, by the page (Id.mk's own count read before and after the edit) and by the worker's runs of slices (each run's ids on its timeline; a run's last batch is recorded with the next edit, so a run's total is its own batches plus the next edit's first); what minting an id costs in the page; the picture printed as a term (as the CLI prints a result) and as data; carried into JS from the term (HazelJitValue.to_js) and from data. Firefox on GitHub's machines.",
